@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed identified command and actual outcome contract
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Consumer
participant "Transport / contract boundary" as B
participant "Resource-owning handler" as H
database "Owned state / command / intent" as DB
participant "Scoped external adapter" as E
Consumer -> B : intended operation / expected versions / command identity
B -> H : validated shape + current attributable context
H -> H : current authority + domain invariants
H -> DB : resolve duplicate intent / guarded local mutation
DB --> H : prior result / committed result / conflict
H --> B : actual result + permitted operation reference
B --> Consumer : documented HTTP / contract result
opt explicitly admitted external effect
 H -> E : durable dispatch via actual worker / attempt identity
 E --> H : authenticated scoped effect observation
 H -> DB : guarded confirmed / partial / unknown outcome
end
Consumer -> B : lookup same operation after lost / pending response
B -> H : operation identity + current context
H -> DB : current-authority permitted outcome lookup
DB --> H : actual recorded outcome or unresolved state
H --> Consumer : safe result; no blind external repeat
note over H,E
 Local commit and HTTP acceptance do not prove remote completion.
 Concrete durable dispatch and reconciliation follow runtime design.
end note
@enduml
